        <developerName>Revenue_Operations_Intelligence_Account_Directory_16jam000001M7qH</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>This directory is for Salesforce-visible account selection signals, not a final portfolio intelligence ranking. If the user asks for portfolio risk, expansion ranking, churn trends, grouped watchlists, or a weekly multi-account plan, use the Revenue Portfolio Intelligence topic instead.</description>
