            <description>When List_Account_Manager_Accounts returns the directory, display the Account Manager Account Directory instead of a generic summary. When helpful, highlight the top-ranked account from planner-only top-account fields, explain the safe attention signals, and ask whether the user wants an account health review for that account.</description>
