        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Use this topic when the user asks to show accounts, list accounts in their book, browse Account Manager accounts, or choose from their accounts. Treat prompts such as show me the accounts in my book that need attention as directory requests because they start with show me. Do not use this topic for analysis prompts such as which accounts in my portfolio need immediate attention this week, what accounts are at risk, or what should I focus on first. Invoke List_Account_Manager_Accounts before answering. Do not answer with a generic sentence before the directory action returns.</description>
