        <masterLabel>Account Manager Account Directory</masterLabel>
        <pluginType>Topic</pluginType>
        <scope>Your job is to help Account Managers browse and choose accounts from their book of business. Use List_Account_Manager_Accounts for show, list, browse, choose, or book-of-business directory requests, including requests that begin with show me and ask for accounts that need attention. Do not answer directory requests with only a generic sentence; display the returned Account Manager Account Directory. Use Summarize_Revenue_Account_Health only as a confirmed follow-up for a selected or top-ranked account from the directory. Do not use this topic for which accounts need immediate attention, what accounts are at risk, what should I focus on first, portfolio-wide risk, expansion, churn, watchlist, or weekly planning analysis.</scope>
